   'An elegant glass board for serving challah, engraved with "The eyes of all look to You" and the "Hamotzi" blessing, with an elegant illustration of blessing hands and a crystal hollow for salt. Standing on stable chrome feet, it combines simplicity and purity with the splendour of a festive, dignified Shabbat table.',
