   'A challah tray made of quality glass with a regal shine, featuring a stunning plaque in gold and silver tones and "Shabbat and Yom Tov" in a delicate artistic design at its centre. Glass feet add stability and elegance. A perfect addition to the Shabbat and holiday table, bringing splendour to every family meal.',
