   'An elegant acrylic challah tray, 45×30 cm, combining luxury and function. Silver "Shabbat Shalom" lettering blends into the modern design. Durable and easy to clean, it is perfect for serving warm challah in style. About 2 cm high, an elegant addition to the Shabbat table.',
